Render as a **diagnostic instrument panel**: gauges, ladders, a stacked-area readout, two spec cards, and a trend strip — ruler-drawn lines, mono technical labels, display face for the headline and key terms, status-indicator color logic. The body is framed as a *system you instrument and read*. Reference points: an engine-bay capacity gauge crossed with a TrainingPeaks/physiology dashboard, drawn with the restraint of an avionics panel. This is a **new sub-archetype** within the locked style — distinct from the lookup matrices (1.1/1.2), the day-strip signal trace (Aesthetic 2.0), the operating-band curve dashboard (3.1), the build-up assembly (3.2), the dual-config datasheet (3.3), and the cutaway powertrain schematic (Athletic 1.0). Lineage stays unmistakable; the instrument is new.

